      "content": "thanks. i'm trying to find a way to frame the chapter on \"modernity vs tradition.\" some scholars suggest that religious liberal views are much more philosophically sophisticated because they integrate modern bioethics with theology, whereas conservative views just end up being a literalist rejection",
